         <a href="https://www.lunialife.com" target="_blank" style="text-decoration:none;">
           <div style="position:relative;">
             <img src="data:image/svg+xml;base64," width="552" style="display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:8px;" alt="">
             <div class="hero-cta-overlay" style="position:absolute;left:50%;bottom:24px;transform:translateX(-50%);width:calc(100% - 48px);max-width:300px;">
         <span style="display:block;background:#f5f5e9;color:#01253f;font-family:Inter,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:18px;line-height:1.3;padding:11px 14px;text-align:center;letter-spacing:0.12em;border-radius:2px;text-transform:uppercase;">Shop the sale →</span>
       </div>
           </div>
         </a>
       </td></tr>
      <tr><td class="h-padding" style="padding:0 24px 16px;">
         <div style="background:#f5f5e9;color:#01253f;text-align:center;font-family:Inter,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:14px 12px;border-radius:6px;">MEMORIAL DAY WEEKEND SALE</div>
       </td></tr>
      <tr><td class="h-padding" style="padding:0 24px 16px;">
       <div class="text-block" style="padding:15px;"><p style="margin:0 0 16px;color:#ffffff;font-size:18.7px;font-weight:300;font-family:Inter,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.6;text-align:left;">Your body starts preparing for sleep about two hours before you feel tired. Core temperature begins to fall, melatonin rises, and cortisol should be near its daily low. Bright light, late meals, and intense exercise all push against this shift, which is why the hour before bed does more for your sleep than anything you do once you are lying down.</p></div>
     </td></tr>
      <tr><td class="h-padding" style="padding:0 24px 16px;">
      <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="table-layout:fixed;">
        <tr>
          <td class="secondary-cell" width="48.91%" style="width:48.91%;vertical-align:top;"><img src="data:image/svg+xml;base64," width="270" style="display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:8px;" alt=""></td>
          <td class="secondary-spacer" width="12" style="width:12px;font-size:0;">&nbsp;</td>
          <td class="secondary-cell" width="48.91%" style="width:48.91%;vertical-align:top;"><img src="data:image/svg+xml;base64," width="270" style="display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:8px;" alt=""></td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </td></tr><tr><td class="h-padding" style="padding:0 24px 16px;">
      <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="table-layout:fixed;">
        <tr>
          <td class="secondary-cell" width="48.91%" style="width:48.91%;vertical-align:top;"><img src="data:image/svg+xml;base64," width="270" style="display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:8px;" alt=""></td>
          <td class="secondary-spacer" width="12" style="width:12px;font-size:0;">&nbsp;</td>
          <td class="secondary-cell" width="48.91%" style="width:48.91%;">&nbsp;</td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </td></tr>
      <tr><td class="h-padding" style="padding:0 24px 16px;">
       <div class="text-block" style="padding:15px;"><p style="margin:0 0 16px;color:#ffffff;font-size:18.7px;font-weight:300;font-family:Inter,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.6;text-align:center;">Protect the window and everything downstream gets easier. That is the whole idea behind Lunia Restore.</p></div>
     </td></tr><tr><td class="h-padding" style="padding:0 24px 16px;">
       <div class="text-block" style="padding:15px;"><p style="margin:0 0 16px;color:#ffffff;font-size:16px;font-weight:300;font-style:italic;font-family:Inter,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.6;text-align:left;">Sale ends Monday at midnight.</p></div>
     </td></tr>
      <tr><td class="h-padding" style="padding:0 24px 24px;" align="center">
    <a class="cta-link" href="https://www.lunialife.com" target="_blank" style="text-decoration:none;display:block;max-width:300px;">
      <span style="display:block;background:#f5f5e9;color:#01253f;font-family:Inter,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:20px;line-height:1.3;padding:13px 14px;text-align:center;letter-spacing:0.12em;border-radius:2px;">Shop the sale</span>
    </a>
  </td></tr>
    </table>
  </td></tr>
</table>
</body></html>"
`;

